    "Any saved checkpoint is kept. Unsaved record changes cannot be recovered after leaving. Your script and readings are safe.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any saved checkpoint is kept. Unsaved record changes cannot be recovered after leaving. Your script and readings are safe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存的部分会保留，未保存的记录离开后无法恢复。讲稿和注音不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存的部分會保留，未保存的記錄離開後無法恢復。講稿和注音不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App data may be included in system device backups. Removing data in Oralo does not erase those backups or copies you exported elsewhere.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App data may be included in system device backups. Removing data in Oralo does not erase those backups or copies you exported elsewhere."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用数据可能包含在系统设备备份中。在 Oralo 内清除数据，不会抹除这些备份或已导出的副本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "應用數據可能包含在系統設備備份中。在 Oralo 內清除數據，不會抹除這些備份或已導出的副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
