    "Chinese: Apple's transliteration, editable by you. English: bundled ipa-dict US IPA. Playback uses a system voice to read the original word, not your edited IPA. Pronunciations never play automatically while presenting.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chinese: Apple's transliteration, editable by you. English: bundled ipa-dict US IPA. Playback uses a system voice to read the original word, not your edited IPA. Pronunciations never play automatically while presenting."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中文采用 Apple 拼音转换，可自行校正；英文采用内置 ipa-dict 美式音标。试听由系统语音朗读原单词，不合成手工修改的音标。演讲中不会自动播放读音。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中文採用 Apple 拼音轉換，可自行校正；英文採用內置 ipa-dict 美式音標。試聽由系統語音朗讀原單詞，不合成手工修改的音標。演講中不會自動播放讀音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chinese: system transliteration, with manual corrections. English: offline ipa-dict US IPA. Audio: system word examples.": {
