    "Deletes scripts, originals, pronunciations, all records, snapshots, recovery copies and app preferences. It does not delete exported files or system device backups.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes scripts, originals, pronunciations, all records, snapshots, recovery copies and app preferences. It does not delete exported files or system device backups."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除讲稿、原文、读音标注、全部记录、快照、恢复副本和应用偏好。不会删除已导出的文件或系统设备备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除講稿、原文、讀音標注、全部記錄、快照、恢復副本和應用偏好。不會刪除已導出的文件或系統設備備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostic reports are shared only when you choose. They contain performance counters, system details and event metadata, not your script, pronunciation notes or full transcript.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnostic reports are shared only when you choose. They contain performance counters, system details and event metadata, not your script, pronunciation notes or full transcript."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在你主动选择时分享诊断报告。报告包含性能计数、系统信息及事件元数据，不含讲稿、读音标注或完整转写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅在你主動選擇時分享診斷報告。報告包含性能計數、系統信息及事件元數據，不含講稿、讀音標注或完整轉寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
