    "The language default applies to new scripts. Existing scripts keep their language. Microphone access is only requested when you check or start voice following.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The language default applies to new scripts. Existing scripts keep their language. Microphone access is only requested when you check or start voice following."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认语言用于新讲稿，已有讲稿保留原来的语言。仅在检查或开启语音跟随时申请麦克风权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默認語言用於新講稿，已有講稿保留原來的語言。僅在檢查或開啓語音跟隨時申請麥克風權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library and its backup could not be read. Existing files have been kept. Retry after restoring access; nothing has been overwritten.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
